    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Ephemeral Frame is a surreal first-person exploration game about going inside pictures</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These may take the form of photos, movies, or other imagery, with each transporting you to a completely different place and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.poster.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.webm?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.mp4?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traverse the Dreamscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world presents a distinct atmosphere alongside its own puzzles to solve and things to find. Hit the arcade, surf the web, golf, or even go fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/f5d4a089792bd1b752b73b61f15ee4dc.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Moments in Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress you will find equipment that can take you further into the dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is one such item, allowing you to create your own frames where and whenever you please and return to them at a moments notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.poster.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.webm?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.mp4?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Together Photo Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reassembling a torn up image you can restore a once-destroyed frame and gain access to the world within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Ephemeral Frame is a surreal first-person exploration game about going inside pictures</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These may take the form of photos, movies, or other imagery, with each transporting you to a completely different place and time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.poster.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.webm?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/33840ff714fada0184acc0ec63ec2640.mp4?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traverse the Dreamscape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world presents a distinct atmosphere alongside its own puzzles to solve and things to find. Hit the arcade, surf the web, golf, or even go fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/f5d4a089792bd1b752b73b61f15ee4dc.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture Moments in Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress you will find equipment that can take you further into the dream. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is one such item, allowing you to create your own frames where and whenever you please and return to them at a moments notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.poster.avif?t=1750125915\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.webm?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605360/extras/d1311d7d06f343f125d33fe870b9683f.mp4?t=1750125915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Together Photo Fragments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reassembling a torn up image you can restore a once-destroyed frame and gain access to the world within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Step inside picture frames, films, and other imagery that connect a variety of dreamscapes in this surreal first-person exploration game.",
